Z||000018||Haze_Performance||10-09-2001||01:37 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Dave Gunsul:<BR><B> Oh yeah, well, um, you never know what you're talking about and I hate your lack of hair, so there you big poopie head! :P<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Archie!!! How can you allow your cheerleader talk to you like that?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  hehe <P>---------------------------------------<P>OK in all reality I think when we had 1000 or so members, everyone talked to each other because we all needed help. Now that the same topics have been brought up 100s of times, some people get tired of answering the same questions over & over.<P><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallindysig_copy.jpg">              .              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallredsig.jpg">        <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners - <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> - Pennocks Wild Rides - <A HREF="http://clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||10
Z||000019||The Fieromaster||10-09-2001||01:44 AM||||For those of you who remember the old "Bud-Light commercials"...<P>Fiero Peeps..... Your My Fiero Peeps.... And I Love You Guys!!!!<P>Common... We dont want to all destroy the great thing we have!  I mean what car has as much "BACK" as Fiero does?? And the damn thing isnt even in production anymore!  Lets see Ford do that with there damn Mustang!!<P>P.S. FieroMaster88... The only thing your car will ever do is TMS!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> haha! J/K... You know your muh bro!<BR>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">         <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">      <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif"">                 <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT></B><BR><p>[This message has been edited by The Fieromaster (edited 10-09-2001).]||||reg||11
Z||000020||Slammed Fiero||10-09-2001||01:51 AM||||Sometimes I think This forum is a migration ground for Retards.<P>Every so often you get a guy come on and tell us how much better his car is than a Fiero. How  he likes the Fiero ,but it will never compare to his 76 AMC pacer..or whatever. I haven't been here to long. My problem is that I argue with them.. Perhaps I should just stand still and hope they sniff me and go away , like some wild animal. I just hate when people come on here and spew inaccuracies. I take it upon myself to correct them. I think from now on I will stop and save myself the headache. It's too bad the internet is such a source of misinformation.<P>It's not the few people on the Forum that think Fiero's are better than everything else in everyway , those people bring humour to us all ..even if they get annoying at times , you can tell these people truly love the Fiero. It's the people who read and spew magazing #'s and think thats the end of the story.<P>Just my 2 cents...from a Fiero lover.<BR>I come here to try and share my little insignificant experiences and learn a lot. I don't even own a Haynes manual or any Fiero related repair book , I rely on the Forum.<P>The moral of the story , we have to take to good with the bad. <P>JM <p>[This message has been edited by Slammed Fiero (edited 10-09-2001).]||||reg||1
